  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、ありがとう\r\nいただくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あさひ、この前も事務所でポテト食べてたよな",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最近、ハマってるのか？",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008010110,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "しょうっすね！　しょっぱいのがいいっひゅ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700801/2017008010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、食べてるときはしゃべらなくていいから\r\nゆっくり食べるんだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それから、あさひ──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008010120,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "なんひゅか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700801/2017008010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ミュージカルのセリフ合わせの日時、\r\n決まったからチェインしておいた。台本は読んだか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008010130,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "まだ最初の方だけっすね",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700801/2017008010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、セリフ合わせの時までには\r\n全体に目を通しておくんだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008010140,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "ふぁいっす",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700801/2017008010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あとは……紅茶教室の予定も入れておいた",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008010150,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "紅茶……？　なんでっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "why",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700801/2017008010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "台本で、あさひのやるメイドが\r\n主人に紅茶を淹れるシーンがあっただろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当に美味しい紅茶を淹れる必要はないんだけど……\r\n本格的な流儀を一度体験してみるのも勉強になると思うから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
